---
title: "transferInvestorPositionWithAuthorization (Legion Sale Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check contract not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_stage: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert: revert Paused
    q_check_stage --> q_verify_sig: valid stage for transfer
    q_check_stage --> q_revert: revert InvalidStage
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_from: cryptographic authorization from investor valid
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_from --> q_check_to: fromInvestor has active position
    q_check_from --> q_revert: revert NoPosition
    q_check_to --> q_transfer_position: toInvestor is valid address
    q_check_to --> q_revert: revert InvalidAddress
    q_transfer_position --> q_clear_from: copy position data from -> to
    q_clear_from --> [*]: clear fromInvestor position, emit PositionTransferred
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_verify_sig
        INV-001: investor cryptographically authorizes the transfer
        INV-002: signature prevents unauthorized position transfers
        INV-003: used signatures marked to prevent replay
    end note
